if you rename a shopkeeper, exit the shop and reenter, the shopkeeper is sort
of not there. but the game will segfault while you're in the shop. a lot. so
i've stopped making use of this particular bug just to save having to save/
restore all the time. the shopkeepers had nothing to do with the priest tho.

personally.. i think if you're gonna do the shopkeeper trick, it should be the
last thing you do on the level, rather than hanging out there for a while after,
tom minimalize the chance of you dying and screwing someone else's game with the
bones file. i lost a really good character <whose save file i hadn't backed up>
to this exact problem.

